---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const title = "My Gear | Editors Gurukul";
export const category = "gear";
---
<Layout title="My Gear | Editors Gurukul" description="The cameras, lenses, and lighting gear Ajay K Meena actually uses for cinematography, color work, and content creation.">


  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>My Gear</h1>
      <p>The actual cameras, lenses, lights, and accessories I use for cinematography, color work, and content creation — no filler recommendations, just what's genuinely in my kit.</p>
      <div class="disclosure2"><b>Disclosure:</b> Amazon links below are affiliate links — buying through them earns a small commission at no extra cost to you.</div>

      <h2 class="cat-heading">Camera</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Sony A7S III</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹3,08,990</div>
          <p>My main body — full-frame, low-light specialist, 4K120, 10-bit 4:2:2. Everything on this site is shot and graded around footage from this camera.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0DGG7N4YK?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="cat-heading">Lenses</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Sony FE 50mm F1.8</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">Budget prime</div>
          <p>My everyday 50mm — sharp, cheap, and light. Lives on the camera for most talking-head and B-roll work.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B01DLMD5O6?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Sony FE 50mm F1.2 GM</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">Premium prime</div>
          <p>The one I reach for when the shot actually matters — GM-level sharpness and the creamiest bokeh in my bag.</p>
          <a class="btn alt" href="https://www.sony.co.in/electronics/lenses/sel50f12gm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check on Sony India</a>
          <p class="gear-note">Not sold directly on Amazon.in — sourced via Sony Center.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="cat-heading">Audio</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="item">
          <h3>FDUCE SL40</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹3,999</div>
          <p>USB/XLR dynamic mic with built-in headphone output — my go-to for voiceovers and talking-head recording.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0D1FQR5TK?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Audio-Technica ATH-M20x</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹4,197</div>
          <p>Studio monitor headphones — flat response, used for audio mixing and voiceover monitoring in Fairlight.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B00HVLUR18?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>realme Buds Air 8</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹3,799</div>
          <p>ANC earbuds for quick on-the-go review and calls — not for critical monitoring, just convenience.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0GDQ7Y8Q5?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="cat-heading">Panel &amp; Bi-Color Lighting</h2>
      <p class="cat-sub">200-300W bi-color panels for key and fill on shoots.</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Digitek DCL-250WBC (250W)</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹8,599</div>
          <p>250W bi-color continuous light with reflector and remote — my main key light on bigger setups.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B09PFXPTF1?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Digitek DFFL 6090 (200W)</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">Bi-Color Flexible</div>
          <p>200W flexible fabric bi-color light — bends around subjects and rigs, handy for tight spaces.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B00BM2BEUU?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>HIFFIN COB-300P (300W)</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹10,896</div>
          <p>300W COB bi-color light with remote control, 2800K-6800K — my highest-output panel for bigger rooms.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0CMJ6X6S7?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="cat-heading">RGB Stick Lights</h2>
      <p class="cat-sub">Full breakdown and comparison in my <a href="/best-rgb-stick-light-2026">RGB Stick Light guide</a>.</p>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Godox LC500R</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">~₹16,000</div>
          <p>My favourite stick light — rotary hue/CCT dial, premium build. Used in almost every setup.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0891R5R58?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Digitek Stick Light</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹4,399</div>
          <p>Budget RGB stick light — removable battery, good backup/second light.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0BCFR26VH?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="cat-heading">Gimbal &amp; Support</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="item">
          <h3>DJI RS 4</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹51,990</div>
          <p>3-axis gimbal stabilizer, 2nd-gen native vertical shooting — my go-to for handheld cinematic movement.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0H7N1V2R4?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Digitek DPTR 880 Pro Tripod</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹2,999</div>
          <p>165cm aluminum tripod with fluid video head — steady locked-off shots and interviews.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B07Y89KS2H?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="cat-heading">Accessories &amp; Studio Setup</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="item">
          <h3>HIFFIN ULANZI Cleaning Kit</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹999</div>
          <p>9-in-1 lens cleaning kit — sensor swabs, blower, cloths. Basic kit maintenance essential.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0CD42ZPLS?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Desidiya RGB Touch Lamp</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹298</div>
          <p>Small RGB bedside lamp — background accent lighting for desk shots and room ambience.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0FHWCLGBR?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Wooden Tripod Floor Lamp</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹1,300</div>
          <p>Decorative shelf floor lamp — part of the studio background décor, not a shooting light.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0H751CWL8?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Green Soul Zodiac Lite Chair</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹6,990</div>
          <p>Ergonomic office chair with lumbar support — where I spend most of my day, in the edit and color suite.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0D473ZDPH?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <h3>Wakefit Standing Desk</h3>
          <div class="gear-price">₹17,999</div>
          <p>Electric height-adjustable desk with memory presets — sit/stand through long edit and grading sessions.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.amazon.in/dp/B0GBXS7ZS2?tag=ajaykmeena-21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Buy on Amazon</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top:20px;"><a href="/camera-guides.html">Camera Guides →</a> · <a href="/free-resources.html">All Free Resources →</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  



</Layout>
